{"Cancellation handlers call async deleteScheduledEmailReminder/deleteScheduledSMSReminder without awaiting or adding them to Promise.all, so Prisma updates/deletes may not complete before the request finishes and reminders may still exist/schedule": 0.9623258709907532, "In deleteScheduledEmailReminder, when immediateDelete=true and referenceId is set, the function sends the SendGrid cancel request but returns without deleting or updating the DB workflowReminder record, leaving orphaned rows": 0.9540798664093018, "scheduleEmailReminders cancels reminders using only cancelled=true and scheduledDate<=now+1h, so it can include past reminders and rows with null referenceId, producing invalid SendGrid cancel requests": 0.9317534565925598, "The initial deleteMany at lines 34-41 removes ALL email reminders with past scheduledDate regardless of cancelled status, running before the cancellation block, so cancelled reminders are deleted without ever calling SendGrid's cancel API": 0.6144914031028748, "The try-catch block wraps the entire loop in scheduleEmailReminders.ts, so if client.request fails for any reminder, the loop breaks, preventing cancellation of all subsequent reminders and causing permanent blockage": 0.966467022895813}